DESKTOP KOTLIN APP VERION 1
# Cubic Music Portable

`CubicMusic-Portable.exe` is the single-file Windows version of Cubic Music.

## Run or share

1. Copy or send only `CubicMusic-Portable.exe`.
2. Double-click it to launch Cubic Music.
3. Allow a few seconds on the first launch while the bundled runtime is prepared.

No installer or additional folder is required. Windows may show a security warning because this personal build is not digitally signed.

## Requirements

- Windows 10 or Windows 11, 64-bit
- Internet access for searching and streaming music
- Approximately 600 MB of free space for the executable and its private runtime cache

The private cache is created automatically under `%LOCALAPPDATA%\CubicMusic\PortableCache` and can be deleted when Cubic Music is closed.

